verlap reduction, exports and saved styles. Keep legacy tangent rotation selectable and recognize older explicit custom-color URLs.\\n- Verify both supplied URLs against their controls, then edit/share/reload to the same SVG. The screenshot values already parsed correctly; inherited defaults and bend construction caused the differences.\\n\\n### Reproduction and verification\\n\\nOpen `/network/?code=1122` and `/network/?code=00000000`, vary Bend, and compare with gallery navigation. Equal endpoint angles/gaps give point-symmetric loops; free endpoints no longer rotate with Bend. Also hover a gallery card and open it in both themes.\\n\\nAutomated coverage: `src/links/geometry-21.test.js`, `src/pages/network-21.test.jsx`, and `npm run test:network:issue21`. Strict symmetry samples, all 4,181 small editor configurations, and 4,693 unchanged gallery/rain SVG hashes guard geometry and scope. Browser checks verify supplied settings, share/reload, dark/light navigation, hover, SVG export and mobile overflow.\\n\\nValidation: 693 unit tests pass; repository checks and production build pass; Chromium, Firefox and WebKit pass the new and existing browser suites. CI also verifies CV PDFs and the Pages build artifact.\\n\\n### Before / after\\n\\n| Original editor | Updated editor |\\n| --- | --- |\\n| ![Before: unequal loops and different colors](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-21-823573f25e74/docs/case-studies/issue-21/screenshots/chromium-before-default-1122.png?raw=true) | ![After: symmetric loops and matching colors](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-21-823573f25e74/docs/case-studies/issue-21/screenshots/chromium-after-default-1122.png?raw=true) |\\n| ![Before: rotated free links](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-21-823573f25e74/docs/case-studies/issue-21/screenshots/chromium-before-default-00000000.png?raw=true) | ![After: anchored curves and cross starts](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-21-823573f25e74/docs/case-studies/issue-21/screenshots/chromium-after-default-00000000.png?raw=true) |\\n\\n![Editor controls with the first supplied configuration](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-21-823573f25e74/docs/case-studies/issue-21/screenshots/chromium-after-supplied-1.png?raw=true)\\n\\n[Complete case study, settings audit, requirement inventory, timeline, root causes, library research, raw logs/data and browser evidence](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/tree/issue-21-823573f25e74/docs/case-studies/issue-21). All causes were traced to this application; no external dependency defect required an upstream report.\\n\", \"comments\": [{\"id\": \"IC_kwDON1sLX88AAAABfUU6pg\", \"author\": {\"login\": \"konard\"}, \"authorAssociation\": \"OWNER\", \"body\": \"<!-- hive-mind:working-session-summary -->\\n## Working session summary\\n\\n[PR #22](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/pull/22) is ready for review and remains unmerged.\\n\\nImplemented symmetric editor defaults, meaningful bending, cross-like starts, matching colors, and hover cleanup. Gallery/rain geometry is preserved.\\n\\nAll 693 tests, Chromium/Firefox/WebKit checks, and CI pass. Before/after screenshots and the complete case study are included.\\n\\n---\\n*This summary was automatically extracted from the AI working session output.*\", \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-25T10:44:52Z\", \"includesCreatedEdit\": false, \"isMinimized\": false, \"minimizedReason\": \"\", \"reactionGroups\": [], \"url\": \"https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/pull/22#issuecomment-6396656294\", \"viewerDidAuthor\": true}, {\"id\": \"IC_kwDON1sLX88AAAABfUVDzA\", \"author\": {\"login\": \"konard\"}, \"authorAssociation\": \"OWNER\", \"body\": \"## 🤖 Solution Draft Log\\nThis log file contains the complete execution trace of the AI solution draft process.\\n\\n### 💰 **Cost estimation:**\\n- Model: GPT-6.1 Sol\\n- Provider: OpenAI\\n- Public pricing estimate: $3.180885\\n\\n### 📊 **Context