[2026-10-27T20:32:43.001Z] [STDERR] +| 20:31 | A final audit extends the native spinner test to an empty inherited field. Both a unit regression and an actual Playwright MCP click reproduce Down returning `0` instead of `0.07`. The follow-up supplies inheritance as an unsaved draft before native pointer stepping, and repeats validation. |
[2026-10-27T20:32:43.008Z] [STDERR] @@
[2026-10-27T20:32:43.015Z] [STDERR] -The old turn input immediately converted an empty string to numeric zero. Clearing the field to type a negative number therefore restored `0` during editing. A controlled numeric component now keeps intermediate empty/minus/decimal drafts while valid values update state immediately. Blur restores an empty required turn/reference to its valid backing value; an empty gap remains an inherited override. Keyboard stepping from a blank gap starts at the inherited global value.
[2026-10-27T20:32:43.020Z] [STDERR] +The old turn input immediately converted an empty string to numeric zero. Clearing the field to type a negative number therefore restored `0` during editing. A controlled numeric component now keeps intermediate empty/minus/decimal drafts while valid values update state immediately. Blur restores an empty required turn/reference to its valid backing value; an empty gap remains an inherited override. Keyboard stepping from a blank gap starts at the inherited global value.
[2026-10-27T20:32:43.027Z] [STDERR] +
[2026-10-27T20:32:43.032Z] [STDERR] +Native mouse stepping needs the same inheritance. The first implementation supplied it only to keyboard navigation; the expanded regression and actual MCP click still produced `0` from native Down on an empty inherited field. `pointerdown` now primes an empty inherited input with a draft of its effective value before the browser's spinner action. Focusing without editing does not save an explicit override, and blur restores the empty inherited display. An actual spinner change commits the new value normally. [Failing unit log](logs/native-inheritance-reproduction.log), [native click trace](logs/native-spinner-before-mcp.log), [passing regression](logs/native-inheritance-fixed.log).
