[2026-10-27T20:34:01.897Z] [STDERR] @@
[2026-10-27T20:34:01.902Z] [STDERR]  Playwright MCP also passes actual mouse clicks on the native number spinner: **Up 0.07→0.08**, **Down 0.08→0.07**, followed by keyboard Up. The controls update the shared URL to equal `0.08 / 0.08` closed gaps. [Result](data/mcp-browser.json), [trace](logs/mcp-browser.log), [screenshot](screenshots/mcp-after-equal.png), [retained script](../../../experiments/issue-27-mcp.mjs). The MCP page and preview server were closed after verification. An initial dynamic-import attempt failed because the MCP VM has no dynamic-import callback. The retained callback uses a named function so formatting cannot add an expression-ending semicolon that the MCP wrapper rejects; its wrapper syntax is checked separately.
[2026-10-27T20:34:01.912Z] [STDERR] +
[2026-10-27T20:34:01.929Z] [STDERR] +## Archived CI and compatibility evidence
[2026-10-27T20:34:01.950Z] [STDERR] +
[2026-10-27T20:34:01.961Z] [STDERR] +The first implementation commit `847d1faa8d3e9ac3028f2cc623ba7574ed248b19` passes [run 40577107753](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/actions/runs/40577107753), created **2026-10-27 20:20:09 UTC**: workflow lint, repository checks, all six browser suites in Chromium/Linux, Firefox/Linux and WebKit/macOS, 736 unit tests, production build and 120 CV PDFs. Deployment is intentionally skipped for pull requests. [Complete CI log](logs/ci-source-40577107753.log), [job metadata](data/ci-source-status.json), [all three artifact manifests, numerical JSON and issue-27 screenshots](ci-evidence/40577107753/). The manifests index every downloaded artifact file by size and SHA-256; unchanged older-suite screenshots already have dedicated case-study archives.
[2026-10-27T20:34:01.976Z] [STDERR] +
