[2026-10-27T20:34:02.012Z] [STDERR] +
[2026-10-27T20:34:02.014Z] [STDERR] +Local compatibility suites pass the original editor/download checks and issues 19, 21 and 23 in Chromium, and issue 25 in all three engines. [Editor log](logs/compat-editor-chromium.log), [issue 19](logs/compat-issue19-chromium.log), [issue 21](logs/compat-issue21-chromium.log), [issue 23](logs/compat-issue23-chromium.log), [issue-25 JSON](data/compat-issue25/). Local gallery regression uses its finite 1,215-card default; CI verifies the exact prior 4,131-card load in every engine. [CV generation](logs/build-cv.log) prints all **120 PDFs**; [dependency audit](logs/audit.log) reports **zero vulnerabilities**. The [repeated historical-schema audit](logs/url-history-audit-final.log) passes and cleans up its temporary Git archives.
